<div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #111827;">
  <h2 style="color:#16a34a;">Your Consultation Request Was Accepted</h2>

  <p>Dear {{citizenName}},</p>

  <p>
    Good news!
    <strong>{{lawyerName}}</strong>
    has accepted your consultation request on
    <strong>LawRoute</strong>.
  </p>

  <p>
    You can now log in to review the case details, share any additional
    information, and communicate securely with your lawyer.
  </p>

  <p>
    <a
      href="{{loginUrl}}"
      style="display:inline-block;padding:8px 14px;background:#16a34a;color:white;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;"
    >Go to LawRoute</a>
  </p>

  <p style="color:#6b7280;margin-top:18px;">Thanks,<br />The LawRoute Team</p>

  <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e6e6e6;margin:18px 0;" />

  <p style="color:#9ca3af;font-size:12px;">©
    {{currentYear}}
    LawRoute. All rights reserved.</p>
</div>